# TEST ONLY (screenshot image and install-verify): pin the default browser to Firefox.
# WHY: the screenshot image carries a second browser (chromium, verification-only) that the
# product does not ship, and the shelf's browser launcher resolves "the default browser"
# from whatever the desktop database offers first - so it flipped between Firefox and
# Chromium from boot to boot. The product does not ship this file (the installed system has
# only Firefox); the file is the XDG default-application store that xdg-settings, KIO and
# Plasma's default-browser resolution read.
[Default Applications]
x-scheme-handler/http=firefox.desktop
x-scheme-handler/https=firefox.desktop
text/html=firefox.desktop
